 ### Yengii Society
 
-**Secretive.** Yengii inventions are not automatically shared; other players cannot play matching cards without a license. Yengii still benefits normally from other species' shared inventions. Flip Yengii's invented research cards as normal, but keep them splayed in front of Yengii rather than in the central splay. Receive the reduced **upper-right Yengii Sharing Bonus** at Confluence. For Yengii’s research-team bid tiebreaks, count **only its uncompleted research teams**. Its invented technologies contribute zero to that count, even though their cards stay splayed in front of Yengii.
-
-**Licensing.** As part of a trade, Yengii may let another player play their own matching species card as if Yengii's technology were shared. That recipient's card enters **permanently**. This can happen in the same Trade in which Yengii invents, before the coming Economy. Licensing cannot restore a card hidden underneath another card as upgrade payment.
